OL,3,AThree arrested in South Africa over one
OL,4,Aof nine women's bodies found
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree suspects have been detained in
OL,7,FSouth Africa in connection with the
OL,8,Fmurder of a woman in an area east of
OL,9,FJohannesburg ` the last of nine recent
OL,10,Fcases in that region that has shone a
OL,11,Fspotlight on the level of violence
OL,12,Fagainst women in the country.
OL,14,FUnder pressure to solve the spate of
OL,15,Fmurders which has involved victims'
OL,16,Fbodies being dumped on a roadside,
OL,17,Fpolice have described the arrests of
OL,18,Fthe three ` a man and two women - as a
OL,19,F"breakthrough".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
