OL,3,AThree arrested in South Africa over one
OL,4,Aof nine women's bodies found
OL,5,
OL,6,FReferring to all nine cases, acting
OL,7,Fpolice chief Lt Gen Puleng Dimpane said
OL,8,Fher officers were "working tirelessly
OL,9,Fto bring those responsible to justice".
OL,11,FThe three suspects are due in court on
OL,12,FMonday morning.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
